WOOD RELEASE (MOKUTON) — RESTRICTED ARCHIVE
Konohagakure — Hokage authorization required

Wood Release is a kekkei genkai combining Earth and Water natures to
generate and control living wood. It is uniquely associated with the
First Hokage, Hashirama Senju, whose power over it earned him the title
God of Shinobi.

Notable Applications (historical):
- Wood Dragon Technique: a massive wooden serpent able to drain chakra.
- Deep Forest Emergence: instant growth of a vast forest.
- Wood Release: capable of suppressing and controlling tailed-beast
  chakra — a power central to the village's early stability.

Restriction: This kekkei genkai is exceedingly rare and cannot be taught
from a scroll; it is inborn. Records are retained for historical and
research reference only. Note: cells derived from the First Hokage have
been the subject of illicit experimentation by defectors — any such
materials are contraband and must be reported to the Hokage's Office.
